is 152 (upstream took 151 for the alternate JS8 submode); the Radio source
drawer section stays id 55. The PDF names v1.23.0 as the base, with diffs
against it, and ends with the appendix "Initial Setup of the QMX/QMX+ for
use with the Tab5-Panadapter", the same text as the README's.

